s significance in medical discussions across different languages.", "ALTERACIONES DE LA MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL:\"ALTERACIONES DE LA MOTILIDAD INTESTINAL\" refers to disorders that impact the normal movement of the intestines. These conditions can significantly disrupt gastrointestinal function, potentially resulting in severe cases that necessitate parenteral nutrition. The term encompasses various issues that hinder the intestines' ability to move food and waste effectively, highlighting the critical nature of these disorders in relation to nutritional health."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}